1
00:00:05,799 --> 00:00:10,697
The dashboard. Read progress, predictions and health

2
00:00:11,235 --> 00:00:16,690
The dashboard is the main screen. Pick goals on the left, read their charts on the right.

3
00:00:16,792 --> 00:00:22,119
Choose whose goals to show: an organization, or your personal goals.

4
00:00:22,257 --> 00:00:26,946
Show check-ins by gives one value per day, week or month.

5
00:00:27,056 --> 00:00:31,791
Each goal shows its color, its progress, and its metrics below it.

6
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:37,361
The eye shows or hides a goal in the charts. Up to eight goals at a time.

7
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:40,916
Show first 8 brings the first eight goals back.

8
00:00:41,018 --> 00:00:49,167
Each line is one metric's progress, from its start to its target. Hover a point to see the actual reading.

9
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:55,077
The dashed line is the prediction: where each metric is heading by the target date.

10
00:00:55,217 --> 00:01:00,846
The badge tells you the health: on track, at risk, off track, or achieved.

11
00:01:00,978 --> 00:01:04,517
Click a goal's title to open its details in a side panel.
